OL,3,GNEWSAWoman denies attempting to murder
OL,4,A100-year-old mother
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman accused of attempting to murder
OL,7,Fher 100-year-old mother with morphine
OL,8,Fhas told a court she had "had a few
OL,9,Fglasses of wine" when she sent a text
OL,10,Fsaying "I'm actually killing her".
OL,12,FSarah Pickering, 72, and her brother,
OL,13,FOxford hotelier Jeremy Mogford, 79, are
OL,14,Fon trial for the attempted murder of
OL,15,FPamela Mogford, who died in February
OL,16,F2022.
OL,18,FThe siblings, who were cleared of their
OL,19,Fmother's murder, deny the charge.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
